[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（美音）]
[ti:Can I Help You, Madam?]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]
[00:10.74]Did the woman get what she wanted? | 那位妇女得到她想要的东西了吗？
[00:15.08]A woman in jeans stood at the window of an expensive shop. | 一位穿牛仔裤的妇女站在一家高档商店的橱窗前。
[00:20.60]Though she hesitated for a moment, | 虽然她犹豫了片刻，
[00:23.77]she finally went in and asked to see a dress that was in the window. | 但最终还是走进去，要求看看橱窗里的一件连衣裙。
[00:30.33]The assistant who served her did not like the way she was dressed. | 接待她的售货员不喜欢她的着装方式。
[00:35.88]Glancing at her scornfully, he told her that the dress was sold. | 他轻蔑地看了她一眼，说那件连衣裙已经卖掉了。
[00:41.89]The woman walked out of the shop angrily and decided to punish the assistant next day. | 这位妇女气愤地走出了商店，决定第二天惩罚一下这个售货员。
[00:48.85]She returned to the shop the following morning dressed in a fur coat, | 第二天上午，她穿着裘皮大衣又来到这家商店，
[00:54.13]with a handbag in one hand and a long umbrella in the other. | 一手拎着提包，一手拿着长柄伞。
[01:00.05]After seeking out the rude assistant, | 她找到那个无礼的售货员后，
[01:02.91]she asked for the same dress. | 要求看昨天那件连衣裙。
[01:06.20]Not realizing who she was, the assistant was eager to serve her this time. | 售货员没有认出她是谁，这一次热情地接待了她。
[01:13.81]With great difficulty, he climbed into the shop window to get the dress. | 他费了好大劲爬进橱窗去取那件衣服。
[01:20.45]As soon as she saw it, the woman said she did not like it. | 那妇女一看到它就说不喜欢。
[01:26.18]She enjoyed herself making the assistant bring almost everything in the window | 她开心地让售货员把橱窗里几乎所有的东西都拿了出来，
[01:32.04]before finally buying the dress she had first asked for. | 最后才买下她最初要看的那件。
